# B5 `J` side, part K5: the slot loop

`PJ.vlL = forL 50 11 3 PJ.vlB` (count `n (2w+1)` on `11`): pushes `gV y` on `SV` and `gC y` on `SC`
for all slots `y` (`Rn.vlL`); both stacks end reversed.
-/

